then other: moment.close
remember pair: m7=gladgone 2m

# At home: the one asking is the stranger here (priority 2, before all the rest).

rule m7_home_re_local_ridgemere
when concept=moment.reply_home self.from=ridgemere here.region=ridgemere
priority 2
say Ridgemere, friend. You're standing in it. It's your voice that's the odd one. | Born three streets over. You're the one with the accent, here. | From here. Every wolf on this street sounds like me.
then other: moment.close
remember pair: m7=local 2m

